            </div>
            <div class="snapshot-row">
              <span>SaaS License Fees:</span>
              <strong class="zero-cost">$0.00 / Month</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="snapshot-actions">
            <a
              href="https://democleankw.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="dofollow"
              class="snapshot-btn"
            >
              <span>Inspect Live democleankw.com</span>
              <ExternalLink size={14} />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Consultation Card -->
        <div class="sidebar-cta-card">
          <span class="badge-pill badge-coral">Technical Strategy Consultation</span>
          <h4>Planning a high-performance service platform in Kuwait?</h4>
          <p>
            Avoid sluggish legacy templates. Partner with webinOO engineers to build a custom edge platform with programmatic local SEO and instant operations dispatch.
